<% content_for :title, 'Ora mobile' %><section class="mobile-launch"><div><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE CLOSER. COMING SOON.</span><h1>Your care.<br><em>Always with you.</em></h1><p>We’re bringing Ora to your phone. The same thoughtful care journey, with a little more ease.</p><%= form_with url: waitlist_path, class: 'waitlist-form' do |f| %><%= f.email_field :email, placeholder: 'Your email address', required: true, 'aria-label': 'Email for mobile launch updates' %><%= f.submit 'Keep me in the loop ↗', class: 'button primary' %><% end %><span class="fine-print">Just a note when we’re ready. Your email stays with Ora.</span></div><div class="phone-mock"><span class="phone-speaker"></span><span class="wordmark">ora</span><div class="phone-content"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT CHAPTER</span><h2>A little more<br><em>possibility.</em></h2><%= image_tag 'ora-editorial.jpg', alt: 'Ora editorial portrait', loading: 'lazy' %><div class="phone-care"><%= icon('heart', size: 20) %> Care, on your terms.</div></div><span class="phone-bar"></span></div></section>
